{"id":"66cf1a1d2a020b74","group":"43","path":"43/43-df-low-weak1generic.md","title":"相对弱一泛型与其低性","display":"df-low-weak1generic — 相对弱一泛型与其低性","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity","book_abbrev":"43","label":"43-df-low-weak1generic","aliases":["43-df-low-weak1generic"],"display":"df-low-weak1generic — 相对弱一泛型与其低性","depends_on":["[[43-df-genericity]]","[[43-df-ce]]","[[43-df-effective-coding]]"],"source_edition":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)","source_locator":"§16.4; Theorem 16.4.7; printed pp.504–505 / PDF pp.524–525; §11.15 Definitions 11.15.6–11.15.7, printed p.287 / PDF p.307","source_scope":"book","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_statement_checked":true,"source_proof_checked":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision_round":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algorithmic Randomness and Complexity"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"43"},{"key":"label","html":"43-df-low-weak1generic"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>43-df-low-weak1generic</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-low-weak1generic — 相对弱一泛型与其低性"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Downey–Hirschfeldt, draft 2007-07-28 (629 PDF pages)"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"§16.4; Theorem 16.4.7; printed pp.504–505 / PDF pp.524–525; §11.15 Definitions 11.15.6–11.15.7, printed p.287 / PDF p.307"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_checked","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\">\\(A\\subseteq\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in2^\\omega\">\\(X\\in2^\\omega\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dense},\\operatorname{Meets},\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\">\\(\\operatorname{Dense},\\operatorname{Meets},\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"39322da73a94b6b8\" href=\"?note=39322da73a94b6b8\" title=\"43-df-genericity\">43-df-genericity</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CE}^A\">\\(\\operatorname{CE}^A\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\#_2\">\\(\\#_2\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6c0559518cd32104\" href=\"?note=6c0559518cd32104\" title=\"43-df-ce\">43-df-ce</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" href=\"?note=aa33e0ea8422ba2a\" title=\"43-df-effective-coding\">43-df-effective-coding</a>。本节引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Weak1Generic}^A\">\\(\\operatorname{Weak1Generic}^A\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Weak1Generic}^A(X)\\iff\\forall V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}^A(\\#_2[V])\\land\\operatorname{Dense}(V)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meets}(X,V)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Weak1Generic}^A(X)\\iff\\forall V\\subseteq2^{&lt;\\omega}\\;\\left(\\operatorname{CE}^A(\\#_2[V])\\land\\operatorname{Dense}(V)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Meets}(X,V)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Weak1Generic}^A(X)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{LowForWeak1Generic}(A)\\iff\\forall X\\in2^\\omega\\;\\left(\\operatorname{WeakNGeneric}(X,1)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{Weak1Generic}^A(X)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只定义弱1泛型的相对版本，oracle并不使数值层级1变成更高层。稠密是有限串延伸意义，避免与某个测度1条件混同。</p>\n<p>来源：用户提供的2007-07-28草稿，§16.4; Theorem 16.4.7; printed pp.504–505 / PDF pp.524–525; §11.15 Definitions 11.15.6–11.15.7, printed p.287 / PDF p.307。本轮逐项比对来源陈述并人工核对类型、参数和去Remark条件；未声称机器形式验证或来源完整证明核验。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"43-df-genericity","status":"resolved","id":"39322da73a94b6b8","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-genericity]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-ce","status":"resolved","id":"6c0559518cd32104","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-ce]]","embed":false},{"target":"43-df-effective-coding","status":"resolved","id":"aa33e0ea8422ba2a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[43-df-effective-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":